        {
          "id": 2217016540,
          "type": "DiffNote",
          "body": "I copied the types from which ones we sort numerically for custom columns that are a single field.\n\nThe default display for absolute times is a string that doesn't sort numerically - and actually the numeric comparisons are slow for columns because it converts the strings to numbers first.",
          "author": {
            "id": 6764551,
            "username": "johnthacker",
