      "title": "dfilter: Access the return types of filter expressions, sort numeric",
      "message": "dfilter: Access the return types of filter expressions, sort numeric\n\nStore the expected return type of a filter (that returns an fvalue\ninstead of just success/failure) when compiling it. Retrieve it\nfor custom columns and use that to decide whether or not to sort\nnumerically instead of always sorting as a string.\n\nFollow up to #15990\n",
      "author_name": "John Thacker",
      "author_email": "johnthacker@gmail.com",
      "authored_date": "2024-11-17T21:32:15.000-05:00",
      "committer_name": "John Thacker",
